{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_DEE84455","title":"Investigate memory loss","entry":"Dlg_DEE84455::entry","exit":"Dlg_DEE84455::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_152A2EB1","articyId":"72057697117167303","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"What do you need stitched up today?","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What do you need stitched up today?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":100.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21659","byteOffset":16084016,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_CDAED3FA","articyId":"72057697117167324","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"I wasn't really. Force 'a habit. If you got stuff wrong go to a med center. I'm more of the emergency response type, yeah?","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I wasn't really. Force 'a habit. If you got stuff wrong go to a med center. I'm more of the emergency response type, yeah?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":700.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25503","byteOffset":17534072,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_125C97B9","articyId":"72057697117167338","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"Pffft, what kind? With all the shit floatin' around that degrades our brains, not to mention the biohacked grafts people buy. Ever see someone's brain cooked from bad wiring?","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Pffft, what kind? With all the shit floatin' around that degrades our brains, not to mention the biohacked grafts people buy. Ever see someone's brain cooked from bad wiring?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1300.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51129","byteOffset":33756128,"byteLength":492}},{"id":"DFr_54585598","articyId":"72057697117167353","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"It's like reverse roasting a turkey. Ding. Ding. Dinner's ready. ","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's like reverse roasting a turkey. Ding. Ding. Dinner's ready. ","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1900.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41831","byteOffset":30153184,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_6FF41C8B","articyId":"72057778721525998","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"What's got you asking?","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What's got you asking?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2500.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45017","byteOffset":31364360,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_FC52BC04","articyId":"72057778721526020","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"Wouldn't that be nice. Just wake up and forget some of the shitty choices we made? Course that means we'd lose the good ones too.","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Wouldn't that be nice. Just wake up and forget some of the shitty choices we made? Course that means we'd lose the good ones too.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3700.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48342","byteOffset":32624408,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_E710CF52","articyId":"72057778721526027","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"Well maybe consult a research interface?","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well maybe consult a research interface?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28927","byteOffset":18826656,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_62E6260E","articyId":"72057778721526049","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"HA! Learn from our mistakes. Man, two weeks ago I brought this guy in for inserting himself into a toaster.","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"HA! Learn from our mistakes. Man, two weeks ago I brought this guy in for inserting himself into a toaster.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":4300.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25894","byteOffset":17679032,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_1616D656","articyId":"72057778721526070","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"Yeah, well, month before we got called to his place because he tried to have sex with a hair dryer. People don't learn from their mistakes my friend. Ever.","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah, well, month before we got called to his place because he tried to have sex with a hair dryer. People don't learn from their mistakes my friend. Ever.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":4900.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45857","byteOffset":31680608,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_92606997","articyId":"72057778721526085","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"What exactly are you trying to forget?","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What exactly are you trying to forget?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4300.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48296","byteOffset":32607176,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_F5E94954","articyId":"72057778721526106","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"I mean some blunt force trauma to the head will take care of that. Though you do run the risk of dying from it so maybe not worth the gamble?","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I mean some blunt force trauma to the head will take care of that. Though you do run the risk of dying from it so maybe not worth the gamble?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4900.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36388","byteOffset":28110832,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_A24265F7","articyId":"72057778721526115","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"Ah, fuck, alright. Look, you didn't get this from me okay?","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ah, fuck, alright. Look, you didn't get this from me okay?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":5500.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49735","byteOffset":33158224,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_AE03F2DD","articyId":"72057778721526142","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"Technically it's called CamBRT3 but we all call it the Camembert Cocktail. It's a dopamine balancer that counter acts delusions and disorganized thinking.","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Technically it's called CamBRT3 but we all call it the Camembert Cocktail. It's a dopamine balancer that counter acts delusions and disorganized thinking.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":6400.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37689","byteOffset":28595600,"byteLength":536}},{"id":"DFr_B2DD24E2","articyId":"72057778721526170","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"Pffft. You ever eat so much of the stuff you're stomach begins to curdle and ferment it's own acid? Had that call once. Guy puked yellow-green for days.","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Pffft. You ever eat so much of the stuff you're stomach begins to curdle and ferment it's own acid? Had that call once. Guy puked yellow-green for days.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":6987.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46204","byteOffset":31810184,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_307C87A3","articyId":"72057778721526179","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"Just give him a small dose. Two drops in a glass of whatever should do it. Anymore will probably kill him. Now if you don't mind I'd like some peace before someone else tries to end their addiction to breathing.","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Just give him a small dose. Two drops in a glass of whatever should do it. Anymore will probably kill him. Now if you don't mind I'd like some peace before someone else tries to end their addiction to breathing.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":7600.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21831","byteOffset":16148072,"byteLength":520}},{"id":"DFr_D1A3E26D","articyId":"72057821671324901","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"What's wrong with you? Do you need medical assistance?","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What's wrong with you? Do you need medical assistance?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":100.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50615","byteOffset":33489032,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_8643C38E","articyId":"72057821671324916","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"R M Alken","text":"That's what they all say. What specific symptoms does your friend have?","speakerId":"Ntt_4318BDFB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's what they all say. What specific symptoms does your friend have?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":700.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16932","byteOffset":14296408,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_6E7DEFD9","articyId":"72057697117167308","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Actually, now that you're asking.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Actually, now that you're asking.","TextSheVersion":"Actually, now that you're asking.","TextTheyVersion":"Actually, now that you're asking."},"e